{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "513db5dfb2d3ee089366b03a0942845faa6d2e4a8df0a4be122308476d7aa45e", "ja": "グラビア撮影　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6000_place", "source_sha256": "bcd396fcad7adc53eaab4ce70b455231dca0500f8aab9c2722cc745161456941", "ja": "ウサギカフェ", "zh": "兔子咖啡馆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6001_p", "source_sha256": "e0f3121f7a764fed45c9cc710332abc7dea7c2b5a6607b1fc8d7e357a1808931", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、茜が\nウサギカフェの店員として働く姿を撮ることになった）", "zh": "（写真杂志《爱格拉！！》决定拍摄茜作为兔子咖啡店员工作的身姿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6002_023aka", "source_sha256": "7a8c9a7516771629c26ea1b58e3914d762e1b16689501b6bfa709a7d042bade0", "ja": "あっ{$P$}ちゃん！　どうどう！？\nいつもとひと味もふた味も違う茜ちゃんは♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！怎么样怎么样！？\n和平时大不一样的小茜哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6003_p", "source_sha256": "5d060c7e12e9eb95729abc1c89f830b8d5f3c553525629567b312d576d1dbd7e", "ja": "よく似合ってるぞ！　茜は、ネコ耳が多いからな。\nウサ耳をつけてるのは、なんだか新鮮だ。", "zh": "很适合你！茜平时总是戴猫耳嘛。  \n戴着兔耳，感觉还挺新鲜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6004_023aka", "source_sha256": "2c2ab3acf952dc32c04c8c727f80d117412c89970fe7ec5ee5bb7213fcbe785c", "ja": "だよねだよね～！　こんなカワイイ茜ちゃんを見れば、\nどんな人も釘付け間違いなし！　のはずなんだけど……", "zh": "对吧对吧～！看到这么可爱的小茜，任何人肯定都会被吸引住！本来应该是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6005_023aka", "source_sha256": "3416185af9b738d91d61e61b0a4128a362035239e9220222e36b421569c2d35e", "ja": "しかーし！　茜ちゃんは知ってしまったのです。\n強力なライバルがいるってことを……！", "zh": "可是！小茜已经发现了，竟然还有强大的对手……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6006_p", "source_sha256": "900e647d4021cfb3976ac48490e9c8cb6578cb928538e3e10bd45f923a563d95", "ja": "そうなのか……？\n茜と同じくらい可愛いライバルなんて、どこに……。", "zh": "是这样吗……？\n和茜一样可爱的竞争对手，究竟在哪里……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6007_023aka", "source_sha256": "55345e763a05db4b933d17910eb7a825bfc6e2726f366866263131d74c9131ca", "ja": "いるじゃん、この空間に！　さっきからお客さんたちの\n注目を集めてる……あのウサちゃんたちだよ～！", "zh": "不就在嘛，在这个空间里！从刚才开始就吸引着客人\n目光的……就是那群小兔兔呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6008_023aka", "source_sha256": "601e61d80910756f4a086800ddf162e9035f993ef98f1b912a335af7b83fa2c9", "ja": "どんな美少女アイドルよりも手強いからね……。\n{$P$}ちゃん、どうすればいい！？", "zh": "因为它们比任何美少女偶像都更难对付……。{$P$}，该怎么办！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6009_p", "source_sha256": "dc15831d63d74044f9f0fe7a498817ad8a385f30e0231947324dd61619c5c678", "ja": "本物のウサギに負けたくないってことか？\nうーん、そういうことなら……。", "zh": "你的意思是，不想输给真正的兔子吗？\n嗯……既然这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6010", "source_sha256": "b89869c76982c2706b7735f643ed12a05e2ae1a61fd6df5b432007eb369e20b4", "ja": "もふもふ！", "zh": "毛茸茸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6011", "source_sha256": "ced7c14bc63313ff6121f7c049aa51d832d94a5f0249ff8f68afd6695d44531d", "ja": "わいわい！", "zh": "热热闹闹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6012", "source_sha256": "db13f7be84be54d4619b11f9eae9dd6da52d04dc435a5ee5af0831b9ffe45134", "ja": "もぐもぐ！", "zh": "大口吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6100_p", "source_sha256": "a367901ade4436faf2a3754d4c599fed830f3f25ef7f7438d307b2275aea832a", "ja": "ウサギ好きな人たちが集まる店だから、耳やしっぽの\nもふもふをアピールするのはどうだろう？", "zh": "因为这是喜欢兔子的人聚集的店，要不要展示一下耳朵和尾巴毛茸茸的样子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6101_023aka", "source_sha256": "a00032a766b1522a021903b4b50ad614871f32aee6d125a492c2ec9cfd54996b", "ja": "なるほど～。たしかに、お客さんみんな……\nうっとりしながらウサちゃんをナデナデしてる。", "zh": "原来如此～。确实，客人们全都……一边陶醉，一边抚摸着兔兔呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6102_023aka", "source_sha256": "a10cc7b7508ecb8f472eb1f4939cdbebb63489e049a77bdefa240efd7df061f6", "ja": "ふふん。撫で心地なら茜ちゃんだって負けてないよ！\nいっぱいアピールして、ナデナデされてくるね♪", "zh": "哼哼，要说摸起来的手感，小茜也不输哦！我要好好表现一番，让大家来摸摸我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6200_p", "source_sha256": "4a8cd04f624a4672a34b94a061153e8cfd009fdbb3dfdf18b16c067e65ff3b17", "ja": "ウサギたちがみんなの視線を独占してるなら、\n茜もその輪に加わって、一緒に遊ぶのはどうだ？", "zh": "要是兔子们吸引了大家的视线，茜也加入其中，一起玩怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6201_023aka", "source_sha256": "afb06abaa95bbfa79bcc7e10bbdcb587d2a5f0028a8923cd2467e4a7cc8425da", "ja": "ウサ耳茜ちゃんとウサちゃんの夢のコラボ……！\nうんうん。カワイイの相乗効果で大注目だね！", "zh": "兔耳小茜和兔兔的梦幻联动……！\n嗯嗯。可爱的叠加效果，肯定会受到万众瞩目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6202_023aka", "source_sha256": "53a2d60b6664e1241ea0952b80435650cfbccc92964fb9cf9fbd5f9317e4b224", "ja": "じゃあさっそく、ご飯を持ってレッツゴー！\nねえねえ！　茜ちゃんも仲間にいれて～！？", "zh": "那就马上带上饭，出发吧！\n喂喂！也让小茜加入我们嘛～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6300_p", "source_sha256": "9f11463a47f564ca59b512ada080494761d574a8b50767874abf6a9738c42ee1", "ja": "食べてる姿が可愛いって聞いたことがあるから、\nウサギみたいにおやつを食べてみる、なんてどうだ？", "zh": "我听说兔子吃东西的样子很可爱，要不要试试看像兔子一样吃点心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6301_023aka", "source_sha256": "1f320b6a952ec37f5d4520768621b4957f2f158d5685aaffd95039f715c1b038", "ja": "美味しそうに食べる姿なら、茜ちゃんに任せてよ！\nカモン店員さーん！　ウサちゃんのおやつプリーズ！", "zh": "要说吃得香喷喷的样子，就交给小茜吧！服务员小姐，来一下——！请给我兔兔的零食！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_6302_023aka", "source_sha256": "db09c214143af77036e962832e5531963b88ce18ac80c5363cdc1840cde18c60", "ja": "……牧草？　これしかないの？\nえっと、プリン味の牧草とかは……ナイ。そっかー。", "zh": "……牧草？　就只有这个吗？\n那个，布丁味的牧草之类的是……没有啊。这样啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
